ft Redgate Corner, just ahead of Caracciola.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":12},{"lap":1,"text":"After the first lap Lang was 4 seconds ahead of Caracciola, Brauchitsch Seaman, Rosemeyer, M\u00fcller and Hasse","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":12},{"lap":2,"text":"On the second lap, Brauchitsch passed Caracciola and Rosemeyer pulled ahead of Seaman.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":2,"text":"On the second lap, Brauchitsch passed Caracciola and Rosemeyer pulled ahead of Seaman.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":3,"text":"On the third lap British driver Richard Seaman was shunted by M\u00fcller up the escape road from where he restarted with crippled rear suspension and a broken shock absorber.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":11},{"lap":3,"text":"On the third lap British driver Richard Seaman was shunted by M\u00fcller up the escape road from where he restarted with crippled rear suspension and a broken shock absorber.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":11},{"lap":4,"text":"On the 4th lap when arriving at Coppice Corner, Seaman was rear-ended by M\u00fcller's Auto Union, sending the Mercedes down the escape road but immediately returned to the course and both cars continued.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":11},{"lap":4,"text":"On the 4th lap when arriving at Coppice Corner, Seaman was rear-ended by M\u00fcller's Auto Union, sending the Mercedes down the escape road but immediately returned to the course and both cars continued.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":11},{"lap":5,"text":"After five laps Lang was leading at 82.6 mph, 7.2 seconds over Brauchitsch, with a gap of 4 seconds to Rosemeyer, then Caracciola.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":12},{"lap":5,"text":"After five laps Lang was leading at 82.6 mph, 7.2 seconds over Brauchitsch, with a gap of 4 seconds to Rosemeyer, then Caracciola.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":12},{"lap":10,"text":"After 10 laps Lang led at 82.96 mph, 3.4 seconds ahead of Brauchitsch with Rosemeyer another 4.4 seconds behind.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":12},{"lap":10,"text":"After 10 laps Lang led at 82.96 mph, 3.4 seconds ahead of Brauchitsch with Rosemeyer another 4.4 seconds behind.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":12},{"lap":11,"text":"Whitehead retires his ERA in a cloud of smoke.","q":false,"c":14},{"lap":11,"text":"Whitehead retires his ERA in a cloud of smoke.","q":false,"c":14},{"lap":14,"text":"Brauchitsch passes Lang for the lead.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":14,"text":"Brauchitsch passes Lang for the lead.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":19,"text":"Martin's ERA retired on lap 19 with a broken piston.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":13},{"lap":19,"text":"Martin's ERA retired on lap 19 with a broken piston.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":13},{"lap":23,"text":"On the 23rd lap, Brauchitsch's left rear tire threw a thread. He stopped at the pits to change both rear wheels and refuel in 30 seconds.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":23,"text":"On the 23rd lap, Brauchitsch's left rear tire threw a thread. He stopped at the pits to change both rear wheels and refuel in 30 seconds.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":24,"text":"On the 24th lap Lang stopped for fuel, tires and had the right front suspension examined but dropped to 7th place.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":12},{"lap":24,"text":"At this time Rosemeyer took the lead at 83.27 mph, 30.8s ahead of Caracciola with Brauchitsch 8.8 seconds behind him","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":24,"text":"On the 24th lap Lang stopped for fuel, tires and had the right front suspension examined but dropped to 7th place.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":12},{"lap":24,"text":"At this time Rosemeyer took the lead at 83.27 mph, 30.8s ahead of Caracciola with Brauchitsch 8.8 seconds behind him","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":26,"text":"Lang's car is undrivable; he drives slowly onto the grass before the pits and retires with a broken front shock absorber.","q":false,"c":12},{"lap":2